OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for town after former House
OL,4,Aof Fraser sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sale of a major high street
OL,7,Fbuilding in a Surrey town could help
OL,8,Fsurrounding retailers to thrive by
OL,9,Fbringing in more shopping day trippers,
OL,10,Fa business group boss says.
OL,12,FGuildford's House of Fraser building,
OL,13,Fwith entrances in the High Street and
OL,14,FNorth Street, was bought by Moretons
OL,15,FInvestments after a three-year closure
OL,16,Fwhich residents say has left a hole in
OL,17,Fthe town's retail offering.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
