OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for town after former House
OL,4,Aof Fraser sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the sale, Amanda Masters,
OL,7,Fchief executive of the Experience
OL,8,FGuildford business improvement
OL,9,Fdistrict, said new retailers could
OL,10,Fbenefit the town's premium shops.
OL,12,FOn the sale, she said: "It's brilliant
OL,13,Fnews. I am just very pleased to have
OL,14,Fsomething happening with it."
